<title>USA: Drew Industries Inc Q2 net rises.</title>
<headline>Drew Industries Inc Q2 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>WHITE PLAINS, N.Y. 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>OPERATING RESULTS(1)</p>
<p>									Last 12</p>
<p>		  Quarter Ended	  6 Mos. Ended    Mos. Ended</p>
<p>		     June 30,		 June 30,	 June 30,</p>
